{"id":3942,"date":"2020-11-01T16:33:50","date_gmt":"2020-11-01T16:33:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lovetoronto.org\/?page_id=3942"},"modified":"2020-11-01T16:49:55","modified_gmt":"2020-11-01T16:49:55","slug":"faq-2","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/lovetoronto.org\/en\/faq-2\/","title":{"rendered":"\uc790\uc8fc \ubb3b\ub294 \uc9c8\ubb38 &#8211; \uc815\uc2e0\uac74\uac15\uc0c1\ub2f4 \uc11c\ube44\uc2a4 &#8211; EN"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><p>[vc_row overlay_dotted=&#8221;&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1586889278434{padding-top: 40px !important;padding-bottom: 40px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_wp_custommenu nav_menu=&#8221;94&#8243; el_class=&#8221;submenu_faq&#8221;][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row overlay_dotted=&#8221;&#8221;][vc_column css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1507715160194{padding-right: 30px !important;}&#8221; el_class=&#8221;grop-col-padding-none&#8221;]<div class=\"panel-group\" id=\"grop-6ad19257a13a41\" role=\"tablist\" aria-multiselectable=\"true\"><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a40\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad19257a13a41\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad19257a13a40\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a40\">Who is eligible for the Psychotherapeutic Counseling Program?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a40\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse  in\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a40\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text] It is open for anyone who is seeking help for their mental health problem.[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a41\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad19257a13a41\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad19257a13a41\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a41\">Who takes charge of the counseling?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a41\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a41\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text]Four Ontario registered psychotherapists are contributing for Love Toronto\u2019s Psychotherapeutic Counseling Program.[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a42\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad19257a13a41\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad19257a13a42\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a42\">How is it different to see a psychotherapist for counseling from seeing a psychiatrist?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a42\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a42\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text]In order to see a psychiatrist, you need a referral from your family doctor and the fees for seeing a psychiatrist will be covered by OHIP.<br \/>\nPsychiatrists see mental health problems caused from malfunctioning of physical structures, and try to improve conditions through treatment with drugs.<br \/>\nOn the other hand, psychologists or psychotherapists focus on the correlation of thoughts, consciousness, and behaviors to help identify the source of the problem and improve conditions through counseling.<br \/>\nThe main difference will be that psychiatrists prescribing medications while psychologists or psychotherapists cannot provide prescription.<br \/>\n[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a43\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad19257a13a41\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad19257a13a43\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a43\">Is it free of charge to see a psychotherapist?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a43\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a43\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text]Psychotherapists receive consultation fees under the academic regulations which is usually $120 per hour.<br \/>\nHowever, Love Toronto\u2019s partner psychotherapists are offering psychotherapeutic counseling at a discounted price of $80 per hour especially for those patients applying through Love Toronto.<br \/>\n[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a44\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad19257a13a41\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad19257a13a44\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a44\">Does health insurance cover consultation fees?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a44\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a44\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text]Medical insurance cannot cover consultation fees, but employment or student insurance do cover them.<br \/>\nYou may discuss with your assigned psychotherapist if you wish the counseling fee to be covered by your insurance.<br \/>\n[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a45\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad19257a13a41\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad19257a13a45\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a45\">What should a patient do when he can\u2019t afford the cost?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a45\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a45\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text]Please contact our Love Toronto program coordinator if you need financial support on psychotherapeutic counseling fee.[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a46\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad19257a13a41\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad19257a13a46\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a46\">Is counseling available over the phone?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a46\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a46\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text]In-person counseling is the statutes of Love Toronto, but you may discuss with a psychotherapist in certain circumstances.[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a47\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad19257a13a41\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad19257a13a47\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a47\">What happens if a patient thinks his assigned psychotherapist is inadequate?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a47\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a47\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text]We are offering the first in-take session for free of charge. Please contact our program coordinator if you find out your psychotherapist is inadequate for your situation.[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"panel panel-default  grop-faq-single\"><div class=\"panel-heading  grop-faq-heading\" role=\"tab\" id=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a48\"><h4 class=\"panel-title\"><a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#grop-6ad19257a13a41\" href=\"#grop-faq-6ad19257a13a48\" aria-controls=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a48\">Is it guaranteed on personal privacy?<\/a><\/h4><\/div><div id=\"grop-faq-6ad19257a13a48\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"grop-faqh-6ad19257a13a48\"><div class=\"panel-body  grop-faq-body\">[vc_column_text]Keeping patients\u2019 personal privacy confidential is the primary principle of psychotherapists and it is also legally insured.[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row full_width=&#8221;stretch_row_content_no_spaces&#8221; overlay_dotted=&#8221;&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1586889283807{margin-top: 40px !important;background-image: url(https:\/\/lovetoronto.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/0.banner_donation.jpg?id=2698) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}&#8221;][vc_column css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1584644856121{padding-top: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;background-color: rgba(10,10,10,0.4) !important;*background-color: rgb(10,10,10) !important;}&#8221;]<div class=\"grop-callout_area  grop-parlx-6ad19257a1436\"><div class=\"grop-vertical_middle  grop-fix grop-callout_container  \"><p><span style=\"font-size: 46px; line-height: 62px; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'BMJUA';\">How to support Love Toronto<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #c3c3c3;\">Your donation will be a great help for our struggling Korean immigrants. Please join us in contributing to Korean society by donating through any of the available payments.<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"calout-btn\"><a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-cause_remor_btn grop-btn-6ad19257a14e3-support-love-toronto   vc_custom_1604248546151\" href=\"\/en\/donation\/\"><span>Support Love To